          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>What is it? </strong></p><p>Wellness Nest™ Shilajit Gummies are a clean, lab-tested vitality formula designed to naturally support your energy, focus, hormones, and performance—without the mess of raw resin.</p><p><strong>How does it help?<br/></strong></p><p>Our gummies are proven to boost testosterone levels, improve sexual health, build muscle mass, increase energy and stamina, enhance mental focus and clarity, cleanse and detoxify the body, strengthen the immune system, and reduce stress and anxiety.</p><p><strong>How to Take It</strong></p><p>We recommend 2 gummy per day for 7 days per week. Results may vary, but most men see improvement in overall health and energy levels within 6-8 weeks.</p><p><strong>Feeling drained, foggy, or out of sync</strong></p><p>Wellness Nest Shilajit Gummies are your daily shortcut to all-day energy, better recovery, and total body balance—backed by science, trusted by thousands.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
