            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>In a 60-day clinical study, men who took Wellness Nest daily saw a measurable increase in testosterone.</p><p>Shilajit, and Ashwagandha work together to naturally support healthy T-levels without synthetic boosters.</p>",
